# Only PopupState needs a qmldir (a QML singleton is unreachable without
# one), but a qmldir takes over type resolution for its whole directory, so
# every component here has to stay listed or it stops resolving.
singleton PopupState 1.0 PopupState.qml
singleton Theme 1.0 Theme.qml
Popup 1.0 Popup.qml
PopupButton 1.0 PopupButton.qml
Sparkline 1.0 Sparkline.qml
WeatherIcon 1.0 WeatherIcon.qml
WifiIcon 1.0 WifiIcon.qml
